    "summary": "With **DRUKHARI** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), your army can contain **HARLEQUINS** and **ANHRATHE** units without the **DRUKHARI** Faction keyword, worth at most these points in total for each [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size):\n\n- **Incursion**: 250 pts\n- **Strike Force**: 500 pts\n- **Onslaught**: 750 pts\n\nNone of the **HARLEQUINS** or **ANHRATHE** models added like this can be your **WARLORD** or get Enhancements.",
